---
import InteractiveMockup from './ui/InteractiveMockup.astro';
---

<section class="py-24 overflow-hidden relative" id="caracteristicas">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-24 relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow/10 border border-hero-glow/20 text-hero-glow text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
        Potencial Sin Límites
      </div>
      <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 block animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        Más que una app, tu <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-hero-glow to-white">aliado profesional</span>
      </span>
      <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        Más que una calculadora. Un ecosistema diseñado para potenciar tu carrera profesional con datos reales.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Feature 1: Estimación Salarial -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center mb-24">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 relative flex justify-center">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-hero-glow/10 blur-[80px] rounded-full -z-10 w-3/4 mx-auto"></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-sm lg:max-w-md">
          <InteractiveMockup imageSrc="/images/feature_salary.png" altText="Estimación Salarial Mockup" trackingContainerId="caracteristicas" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Estimación Salarial Precisa</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Nuestra Inteligencia Artificial evalúa tus competencias, experiencia y nivel de idiomas para calcular un rango salarial realista basado en tu mercado actual.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Cálculo personalizado por competencias</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Desglose por nivel de experiencia</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Evaluación del impacto de tus idiomas</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 2: Compatibilidad Laboral -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center mb-24">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Compatibilidad Laboral (Job Match)</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Deja de adivinar si estás calificado para un puesto. Nuestra IA compara tu perfil profesional exacto contra las descripciones de cargo reales del mercado.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Porcentaje de compatibilidad real</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Identificación de habilidades faltantes</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Recomendaciones de roles alternativos</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex justify-center">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-hero-glow/10 blur-[80px] rounded-full -z-10 w-3/4 mx-auto"></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-sm lg:max-w-md">
          <InteractiveMockup imageSrc="/images/feature_match.png" altText="Job Match AI Mockup" trackingContainerId="caracteristicas" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 3: Rutas de Crecimiento -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center mb-24">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 relative flex justify-center">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-hero-glow/10 blur-[80px] rounded-full -z-10 w-3/4 mx-auto"></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-sm lg:max-w-md">
          <InteractiveMockup imageSrc="/images/feature_growth.png" altText="Rutas de Crecimiento Mockup" trackingContainerId="caracteristicas" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Rutas de Crecimiento Acelerado</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Si quieres aumentar tu salario o alcanzar un puesto superior, Valora te construye un mapa exacto de lo que debes aprender o mejorar para lograrlo.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Sugerencias de competencias en demanda</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Certificaciones clave recomendadas</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Análisis de impacto salarial esperado</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature 4: Valoración de Proyectos -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Cotización de Proyectos Independientes</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          ¿No sabes cuánto cobrar por un servicio freelance o un desarrollo? Ingresa los detalles y nuestra IA calculará un presupuesto justo y competitivo según el mercado.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Estimación financiera precisa de tu trabajo</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Análisis de complejidad y tiempo requerido</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-gray-300 group cursor-default">
            <div class="relative shrink-0 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-dashed border-hero-glow/40 group-hover:animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] transition-all duration-300"></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-1 rounded-full border border-hero-glow/20 group-hover:border-hero-glow/60 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-hero-glow shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,1)] group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">Argumentos sólidos para negociar presupuestos</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex justify-center">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-hero-glow/10 blur-[80px] rounded-full -z-10 w-3/4 mx-auto"></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-sm lg:max-w-md">
          <InteractiveMockup imageSrc="/images/feature_projects.png" altText="Valoración de Proyectos Mockup" trackingContainerId="caracteristicas" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
